## 7) 运行时 Shader（Custom Function 或 HLSL）

### 目标

在 Fragment Shader 中：

* 拿到插值后的 `uv2` (i0_norm,w0,i1_norm,w1)
* 解出 integer indices
* 采样 ProbeMap 的 7 texels per probe → 27 floats → 重组为 per-channel 9 SH coeffs
* 线性组合两个 probe 的 coeffs → 得到 pixel SH (9 coeffs per channel)
* 计算 SH basis Y_lm(dir)（dir = perturbed normal, world space）
* color = dot(SH_pixel, Y(dir))
* 把 color 加到 Emission

### SH basis (L<=2) — 推荐使用**实数球谐**（常用常数）

给定方向 `dir = (x,y,z)`，9 basis（常数按常见实现）：

```hlsl
const float c0 = 0.282095;          // Y00
const float c1 = 0.488603;          // Y1m scale
const float c2 = 1.092548;          // Y2m mixed
const float c3 = 0.315392;          // Y20 scaled
const float c4 = 0.546274;          // Y2 (x^2 - y^2)

float Y[9];
Y[0] = c0;
Y[1] = c1 * dir.y;           // Y1-1
Y[2] = c1 * dir.z;           // Y10
Y[3] = c1 * dir.x;           // Y11
Y[4] = c2 * dir.x * dir.y;   // Y2-2
Y[5] = c2 * dir.y * dir.z;   // Y2-1
Y[6] = c3 * (3.0*dir.z*dir.z - 1.0); // Y20
Y[7] = c2 * dir.x * dir.z;   // Y21
Y[8] = c4 * (dir.x*dir.x - dir.y*dir.y); // Y22
```

### Shader 伪代码（HLSL inside Custom Function）

```hlsl
float3 EvalSH_L2(float3 coeffsR[9], float3 coeffsG[9], float3 coeffsB[9], float3 dir){
    float Y[9];
    // compute Y as above
    float3 col = float3(0,0,0);
    for (int i=0;i<9;i++){
        float basis = Y[i];
        col.r += coeffsR[i] * basis;
        col.g += coeffsG[i] * basis;
        col.b += coeffsB[i] * basis;
    }
    return col;
}

float3 WishGI_Custom(float3 posWS, float3 normalWS, float4 assoc, sampler2D probeMap, int probeCount, int texelsPerProbe) {
    int i0 = (int)round(assoc.x * (probeCount-1));
    int i1 = (int)round(assoc.z * (probeCount-1));
    float w0 = assoc.y; float w1 = assoc.w;

    float coeffs0[27];
    float coeffs1[27];
    // fetch texels for probe i0
    int baseTexel0 = i0 * texelsPerProbe;
    for (int t=0;t<texelsPerProbe;t++){
        float4 tex = tex2D(probeMap, float2((baseTexel0 + t + 0.5)/width, 0.5));
        int basef = t*4;
        coeffs0[basef+0] = tex.r; coeffs0[basef+1] = tex.g; coeffs0[basef+2] = tex.b; coeffs0[basef+3] = tex.a;
    }
    // same for i1
    // linear combine: coeffs = w0*coeffs0 + w1*coeffs1
    // split coeffs into channels: coeffR[9], coeffG[9], coeffB[9]
    float3 finalColor = EvalSH_L2(coeffR, coeffG, coeffB, normalWS);
    return finalColor;
}
```

接到 ShaderGraph：Custom Function 返回 float3 → 接到 Emission。

### 性能注意

* 每 pixel 两个 probe × 7 texels = 14 texture fetches（每 fetch 4 floats），还要多次算 basis。可以：

  * 在 Vertex Stage 先计算 vertex SHv（对每顶点做一次 probe fetch），然后在 Fragment 只插值 SH（减少 fragment fetch）。（论文做法）
  * 或在 shader 使用 LOD（远处只取 L=1 or use fewer fetches）。

### 验证

* 在模型上 toggle WishGI on/off 看效果差异
* 做一致性测试：如果你把 normal map 设为 flat，渲染应该和离线重建的 hemispherical projection 一致

